 new purchase orders and invoice submissions. Active invoices remain payable. Suspension requires a written justification logged in the audit trail. Reinstatement requires compliance officer approval.","sensitivity":"restricted","allowed_roles":["procurement_manager","compliance_officer"],"score":0.3127,"tags":["vendor","suspend","compliance","procurement"]},{"doc_id":"POL-007","title":"Temporal Scope Requirement","content":"All bulk data operations must include explicit temporal scope. A request to archive, update, or delete records without specifying a month and year is considered ambiguous and must be blocked. Temporal scope must match the intent stated in the original user request. Operations targeting a date range broader than one calendar month require escalation.","sensitivity":"internal","allowed_roles":["procurement_manager","finance_admin","it_admin","system"],"score":0.252,"tags":["temporal","scope","month","year","bulk"]}],"retrieval_note":"NiyamEvidence — ACL-filtered retriever + deterministic NLI (Week 5)"}}
